From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gork CI <gork-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 17:15:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] official-stable-vcs-watch-parity: avoid workspace-wide branch watches

When current git branch / HEAD tracking is the only filesystem consumer, arm
only the governing VCS metadata instead of recursively watching the workspace.
Keep the existing git-lock state machine and HEAD-change debounce semantics.

Gork-Patch-Id: official-stable-vcs-watch-parity
Gork-Invariant: branch-only-tracking-does-not-watch-workspace-tree
Gork-Risk: critical
---
